      <PrimaryExemptPurposeTxt>THE CLUB MAKES POLO AVAILABLE TO THE COMMUNITY AT LARGE AT REASONABLE PRICES, INCLUDING OFFERING HORSES FOR USE, LESSONS, TOURNAMENTS, HORSEMANSHIP, HORSE CARE. IT PROVIDES MEMBERS OF THE COMMUNITY THE OPPORTUNITY TO BECOME INVOLVED IN A COMMUNITY OF HORSELOVING PEOPLE, GIVES THEM THE OPPORTUNITY TO HAVE LEADERSHIP POSITIONS AND TO ENRICH THE LIVES OF OTHERS AROUND THEM. THE CLUB ALSO TAKES IN DONATIONS OF HORSES FROM OTHER PEOPLE FROM OTHER POLO PLAYERS WHO CAN NO LONGER USE THEM BECAUSE THEY ARE GETTING TOO OLD TO GIVE THEM HOMES AND A SOFTER LANDING TO BE USED IN A LOWER LEVEL OF POLO FOR THE CLUBS NEW MEMBERS WHO ARE JUST LEARNING TO PLAY POLO. THROUGH THE CLUBS EFFORTS IN FUNDRAISING, TEACHING LESSONS AND MEMBERSHIPS THE HORSES BOARD AND VETERINARY COSTS ARE COVERED.</PrimaryExemptPurposeTxt>
